  "bodyHash": "89e7481913f60b7f",
  "content": "\n\n<p>本模組是 Vazkii 所創作的「藥水手指」(Potion Fingers) 的移植版。</p>\n<p>原始模組：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/potion-fingers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/potion-fingers</a></p>\n<p>尋找 Fabric 版本嗎？您可以在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/potion-ring-reforged-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>找到。</p>\n<p>我非常喜歡這個模組，但很遺憾它沒有更新或移植到新版 Minecraft，因此我重新製作並移植了這個版本。</p>\n<p>此移植版包含新的 API，現在需要將 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios</a> 設為 Minecraft 1.16.5-1.21.1 的相依模組。</p>\n<p><strong>戒指</strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/301/2025-03-23_15.png\"></p>\n<p><strong>可疊加效果</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/293/2025-03-23_13-51-48-png.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/294/2025-03-23_13-52-24-png.png\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>合成配方</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/302/2025-03-23_15.png\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/303/2025-03-23_15.png\"></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/304/2025-03-23_15.png\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><strong>自訂戒指</strong></p>\n<p><br>在 Potion Ring Reforged 2.0 中，您可以使用模組新增的效果來建立自訂戒指。</p>\n<p>請查看維基以了解如何建立自訂戒指：<a href=\"https://github.com/Samlegamer/PotionRingReforged/wiki/How-to-create-a-custom-ring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Samlegamer/PotionRingReforged/wiki/How-to-create-a-custom-ring</a><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/326/2025-03-15_14.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>相容整合<em>&nbsp;與&nbsp;</em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/size-shifting-potions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Size Shifting Potions</a></strong> (1.19.2 及以上版本)<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/292/2025-03-23_15-27-54-png.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Curios</strong>：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>CraftTweaker：</p>\n<p>戒指不再使用標籤，現在都是獨立的物品。<br>以下是一個小範例：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>craftingTable.addShaped(\"mycustomrecipe\",&nbsp;</span><span>item:potionring:ring_of_regeneration</span><span>, </span></p>\n<p><span>[ [</span><span>item:minecraft:nether_star</span><span>,&nbsp;</span><span>item:minecraft:ghast_tear</span><span>,&nbsp;</span><span>item:minecraft:air</span><span>], </span></p>\n<p><span>[</span><span>item:minecraft:ghast_tear</span><span>,&nbsp;</span><span>item:potionring:potion_ring</span><span>,&nbsp;</span><span>item:minecraft:ghast_tear</span><span>], </span></p>\n<p><span>[</span><span>item:minecraft:air</span><span>,&nbsp;</span><span>item:minecraft:ghast_tear</span><span>,&nbsp;</span><span>item:minecraft:air</span><span>]]);</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
